17. Expected Progress Logic
The project progress is calculated like this:
Final Project Progress =(Task Progress Average × 70%)+(Milestone Progress Average × 30%)
Example:
Task Score      = 75%Milestone Score = 50%Final Progress =75 × 0.70 + 50 × 0.30= 52.5 + 15= 67.5≈ 68%
Status logic:
0%             -> not_started1% to 99%      -> in_progress100%           -> completedAny blocked task -> blocked

